# Build artifacts
/target
**/target/
# `**/target/` above would also match vendored crates whose package contains a
# `src/target/` subdir (e.g. cc-1.3.0). Vendored crates are committed wholesale
# for offline builds, so re-include everything under vendor/ (subsequent rules
# below must not un-ignore them).
!vendor/
!vendor/**
!vendor/**/target/
!vendor/**/target/**

# Release tarballs produced by tools/release-artifacts.sh (Checkpoint 3.2) —
# regenerated per release, never committed.
/dist

# Vendored crates are regenerated by `make vendor` and intentionally committed
# for offline reproducible builds (spec §2). Uncomment to ignore locally if
# regenerating frequently:
# /vendor

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.rs.bk

# Local env / secrets — never committed (global CLAUDE.md: never commit secrets)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
!vendor/**/*.pem
!vendor/**/*.key
/data/